ackawanna &amp; Western Railroad v. Yurkonis\">238 U. S. 439, 444</a></span>. (2) <em>Spencer </em>v. <em>Duplan Silk Co., </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"95965\"><a href=\"/opinion/95965/spencer-v-duplan-silk-co/#530\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Spencer v. Duplan Silk Co.\">191 U. S. 526, 530</a></span>; <em>Devine </em>v. <em>Los Angeles, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"96478\"><a href=\"/opinion/96478/devine-v-los-angeles/#333\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Devine v. Los Angeles\">202 U. S. 313, 333</a></span>; <em>St. Anthony Church </em>v. <em>Pennsylvania R. R. Co., </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1115043\"><a href=\"/opinion/1115043/roman-catholic-church-of-st-anthony-of-padua-v-pennsylvania-railroad/#577\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Roman Catholic Church of St. Anthony of Padua v....\">237 U. S. 575, 577, 578</a></span>; <em>Norton </em>v. <em>Whiteside, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"98563\"><a href=\"/opinion/98563/norton-v-whiteside/#147\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Norton v. Whiteside\">239 U. S. 144, 147</a></span>. <em>Mr. E. A. Walton </em>and <em>Mr. Charles C. Dey </em>for appellant. <em>Mr. William W. Ray </em>for appellees.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}